; A table that defines a language replaces the built-in list, so German,
; French and Polish are listed again with the engine's built-in values.
#Supported Languages
$Language: German
+XSTR: 1889
+Extension: gr
+Special Character Index: 164
$Language: French
+XSTR: 1890
+Extension: fr
+Special Character Index: 164
$Language: Polish
+XSTR: 1891
+Extension: pl
+Special Character Index: 127
$Language: Chinese (CN)
+Extension: cn
+Special Character Index: 0
#End
